OL,3,ABriton among six killed in Krakow
OL,4,Ashooting as police say three other
OL,5,Abodies found are suspect's family
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are continuing to investigate
OL,8,Fafter six people were killed in a
OL,9,Fshooting in Krakow on Saturday - here's
OL,10,Fwhat we know
OL,12,FThe head of Poland's police force,
OL,13,FMarek BoroED, says 16 more people were
OL,14,Finjured, including two police officers,
OL,15,Ffive foreign nationals and the suspect
OL,17,FHours after the attack, Polish PM
OL,18,FDonald Tusk said three other bodies
OL,19,Fwere found at the suspect's home, which
OL,20,Fis still being searched
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
