OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice say the bodies have now been
OL,8,Fidentified as the suspect's parents and
OL,9,Fsister
OL,11,FLate on Saturday, Poland's interior
OL,12,Fminister described the suspect - a
OL,13,F25-year-old Polish citizen - as being
OL,14,Finspired by "far-right ideologies";
OL,15,Fpolice said he used "military weapons"
OL,16,Fin the attack
